  m_Name: Lore4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_04
  title: The Graveyard
  fullText: 'At first I believed souls vanished when lost.

    I know better now.


    Souls
    gather here.

    Forgotten strength.

    Forgotten memories.

    Forgotten
    cards.


    Offer enough...

    And some things may return.

    Though not
    always permanent.


    The Graveyard remembers, now...

    Try to Remember.'
